{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":55,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["上帝施恩典"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"“来吧！所有口渴的人啊，来喝水吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"没有钱的人啊，来买东西吃吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"来买酒买奶吧，不花钱，不付费！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们为什么花钱买不能吃的食物？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为什么拿辛苦赚来的钱买不能令人饱足的东西？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要留心听我的话，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就可以吃美物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"享受丰盛的佳肴。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要到我这里来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"侧耳听我的话，就必存活。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要跟你们立永远的约，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"将应许大卫的可靠恩福赐给你们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，我使他向万民做见证，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"立他作万民的领袖和统帅。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，你必召集素不认识的国民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不认识你的国民必来投奔你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为以色列的圣者——你的上帝耶和华赐给你荣耀。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"要趁着还可以找到耶和华的时候寻找祂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"趁祂还在附近的时候求告祂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿邪恶的人停止作恶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不义的人除掉恶念。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿他们归向耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必怜悯他们；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿他们归向我们的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必大施赦免。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：“我的意念并非你们的意念，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的道路并非你们的道路。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"正如天高过地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的道路也高过你们的道路，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的意念也高过你们的意念。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雨雪从天降下，并不返回，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"而是要滋润大地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使地上的植物发芽生长，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叫播种的有种子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吃饭的有食粮。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"同样，我口中所出的话也不会徒然返回，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"而是要成就我的旨意，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"实现我的计划。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们必欢欢喜喜地出来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"平平安安地蒙引导，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大山小山都要在你们面前歌唱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"田野的树木也都拍掌。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"曾经的荆棘之地必长出松树，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"曾经的蒺藜之地必长出番石榴。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这必使耶和华扬名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是永远长存的记号。”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/55.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/56.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/54.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}